{"server":"cn","storyId":"act17side_level_act17side_st12","groupId":"act17side","stageId":"act17side_10","title":"格兰法洛","storyCode":"SN-ST-12","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_st12.txt","sourceHash":"d50eb20e38bab2a9b3347d6b22cc3eb414fb334a0b518cfe4fa4d8586a4bc0e6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼哈——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"上来！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快！抓住我的手！"},{"type":"narration","text":"一艘小船。\n这里离伊比利亚之眼有多远？离格兰法洛有多远？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，啊，好的——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"艾丽妮握住了他的手。\n阿戈尔人的手和黎博利的没有区别。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——抱、抱歉——我力气稍微有点小......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我远远看见那艘船爆炸的时候——真的吓了一跳！你们还好吗！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没事就好。调整呼吸，总会游泳吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好现在还算风平浪静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊......哈啊......其他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......确认一些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才那是......阿戈尔？这么近？斯图提斐拉一直在阿戈尔城市的上面打转？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们也许可以想办法回那座城市看看情况，可是你坚持不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，队长似乎也不太同意我们就这么开开心心地回家。城市不会这么靠近陆地，我对那座城市完全没有记忆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳咳......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你们要，回到那座城市吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不。歌蕾蒂娅说，这里同时也是海嗣的领地。这座城市，是避难退居于此的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被你们称作岛民的阿戈尔人，就是那些靠近陆地的城市崩溃后逃离的难民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们应该去帮助他们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌尔比安没死，他也拒绝与我们同行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这附近还有其他的海嗣，它们被那场进化吸引而来，整个族群无比躁动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可以趁现在杀回去，但我们再也出不来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们......总算见到了故乡的城市，现在，又要背对着它离开？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂娅无言地看了一眼斯卡蒂。\n她掩饰得很好。就像在一切静谧的瞬间，她轻抚脖颈那时一样掩饰得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们似乎别无选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里不该有一座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......我们应该回到岸边，重整旗鼓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的职责是护卫阿戈尔，而不是，“回家”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么做到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，啊，您和我说话？您指什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这艘船比我们的那艘还要简陋。你怎么确定我们的位置？这片大海如此宽广。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......我比对了“愚人号”每一次发出信号的位置......发现了一些规律，所以我就想，呃......碰碰运气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"运气？这个规律的轨迹误差有多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，两三百海里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不能称之为规律。如果你赌错了，你几乎没有机会追上我们，你会死在海上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是个奇迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那个......我想问一个问题......请审判官阁下不要笑我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我笑不出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我现在，是一个伟大的人吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的祖父母，你的父母，乔迪，格兰法洛的两代人，他们都曾为了这个蓝图努力。他们本该......永远伟大，真的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不算吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是个幸运儿罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师......以及审判庭的其他同僚之间，总流传着这样的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有牺牲者才配得上“伟大”一词。在我们努力存活并为伊比利亚而战的每一刻，我们都只是背负着巨大责任前行的普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并非审判官们喜欢妄自菲薄。我们选择最残酷的方式对待伊比利亚，是因为松懈的瞬间我们就会被摧垮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在那之前，只要人的意志能够点亮这盏提灯，我想，我们就没有差别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像......那些以自己的方式苦苦挣扎的市民。那些还能留存善意的、为家园的复兴甘愿牺牲的战士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就像曾经格兰法洛的工人们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......乔迪，幸运不会一直眷顾你的。如果你有机会再与审判庭接触......呃。我是说，与我们合作——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你会有机会的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈......呃，我其实只是......那个，一时兴起才问的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位从斯图提斐拉带回了不朽的知识，各位才是真正的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一口气救下了三位深海猎人。作为阿戈尔人，你甚至可以以此受到执政官本人的表彰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......游回去，会很吃力。而且在它们的巢穴上方，没人知道会发生什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不太明白格兰法洛出生的你到底有什么执念......但是，做得不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以阿戈尔人......以及伊比利亚人的角度来说都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们回家吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欢迎回来，猎人们。还有，艾丽妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......长官他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怎么知道的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经整理好他的遗物。包括那些战死在灯塔下的同志一并。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在惩戒军抵达之前，我们没有办法处置他们的遗物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"低等恐鱼无法击败大审判官达里奥，但为了守护伊比利亚之眼，他选择以生命拖延时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"审判官没有时间哀伤，艾丽妮。达里奥对你寄予厚望，你必须前进下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的提灯还完好无损，就放在那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来惩戒军遇到了一些麻烦。我并没有看见伊比利亚引以为傲的海上军事力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“愚人号”沉没了。这个结果并非我们所预想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。这对我们来说，无疑算作一次挫折。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我们得到了更多的消息，以及......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们发现了阿戈尔的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希已经与我分享了她的推测，也许你也该听一听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"审判庭一直坚信能控制一切。从盐风城，到斯图提斐拉......我们会逐步夺回属于伊比利亚的荣光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但也许，我们不得不承认，即使是保持现状，也足以让审判庭......捉襟见肘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"执政官阁下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们在那艘船上见到了什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g20_lighthouse_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......提灯。这是长官的提灯......焦黑，还有恐鱼的气味......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......长官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我完成了审判庭的任务！！找到了斯图提斐拉号！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尽管它不幸沉没！但——船上的——每一个伊比利亚人！都以自己的方式，抗争到了最后！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经——理解了审判的含义，理解了我们所面对的敌人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——不会犹豫，也不会怯懦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是为了伊比利亚的存续，为了同伊比利亚的敌人而战，为了守卫伊比利亚的洁净与德行，提起了剑与灯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿方索他......这不可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"六十多年，这是怎么样的折磨！接受最残酷刑罚的罪犯，也撑不过一年！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他......他......"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡门渐渐沉默。他弯下了腰，坐在礁石上。\n恐鱼的尸体堆积成山。这里再也没有一丁点异类的痕迹，只有残余的溟痕，退向大海，让海面散发出淡淡的蓝光，抢夺了天空的特权。\n他本该胜利了。他做到了审判庭一直以来想做的事情。惩戒军即将抵达，这一切都趋于美满。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"但他只是沉默。\n直到远方传来轰鸣的汽笛声。惩戒军抵达了伊比利亚之眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以从这里看见小镇的角落。我记得，这座山丘叫做......重建丘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亚戈并不是平静地死去的，我并不知道那是好是坏......但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在一场肃穆的葬礼上，为英雄献上一曲，也不是什么坏事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"Frost似乎回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我们一会就回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？这些日子，你受了不少苦吧，伊比利亚人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格兰法洛是蒂亚戈的家乡。阿戈尔是各位，以及我那些深海猎人朋友们的家乡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许平时玩笑开太多，大家都忘啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亚也是我的家乡。说真的，我现在心里并不是滋味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个医生没打算帮你做点什么吗？你不是替她工作的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我们已经做了。这也是我愿意留在罗德岛的原因嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我自己还什么都没做呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g17_lighthouse_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快、快！把物资搬进仓库！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，帐篷的数量呢？那位老爷不是交代过吗！？唔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔、乔迪？你回来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么......审判庭竟然把你抓了又放回来了？你去哪儿了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有好多惩戒军把我们带走，我们又跟着他们回到小镇......他们好像在和什么东西打仗，现在他们要我们帮忙搭帐篷啥的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格兰法洛会变成什么样？呃，还有，你看见蒂亚戈了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔迪·方塔纳罗萨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......圣、圣徒大人......还有审判官阁下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我们与这位阿戈尔人单独聊一聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，当然！您请！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我来。随便走走吧，在这座小镇上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g18_lighthouse_square"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾丽妮在回程的路上做出了决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"决、决定？什么决定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来，按照大审判官达里奥的想法，他意欲将艾丽妮托付于我，由我栽培，直到她能胜任大审判官的席位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达里奥的战死在预料之外——这一天迟早会来临，但达里奥本不必如此之快地接受命运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是艾丽妮下定了决心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她将，放弃审判官的职位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！呃，什么？为什么！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我自己的决定。我有我自己的考虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些与你无关，请接着听下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"问题在你，阿戈尔人。你知道太多，深入太多，而这座小镇里的阿戈尔人，也亵渎太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你也帮了我们许多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脆弱如你，本是死也如沙粒般渺小的。但你却，展现了力量。即使那只是你自己小小的火种，也难能可贵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我只是在想......自己为什么活着，我没有各位这么高尚，也不坚定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔迪，你将会......成为第一位加入审判庭的阿戈尔人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？欸？我？加入审判庭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"严格来说，你没有拒绝的机会。格兰法洛需要更多人手，而一个阿戈尔人，将起到举足轻重的作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这之后，嗯，也许我还需要一位年轻的书记......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我？加入审判庭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我并不想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你不想。很多审判庭成员，以及那些对阿戈尔的偏见根深蒂固的人，同样不想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你不想看看......伊比利亚曾经许诺给格兰法洛，许诺给蒂亚戈的那个未来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加入审判庭是一次考验。作为阿戈尔人，你当做苦行或是磨难也没差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别误会了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......我考虑一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，审判官阁下呢？您的老师......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"审判官的身份不利于我与深海猎人，甚至阿戈尔接触，所以我才抛弃了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抛弃一段支撑我至今的信念......在老师不幸战死后抛弃它，并不是一件轻松的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请......请暂时不要追问更多了。如果我们之后还能相遇，那时再说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......"},{"type":"narration","text":"艾丽妮看向了广场中的雕塑。一个缩小版的伊比利亚之眼。\n在战乱中破碎的街道，毁坏的房屋，临时搭建的帐篷。\n它始终看着这一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我们面对的已经远超律法的范畴，伊比利亚也必将清算这些亵渎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们必将获胜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Frost，请允许我表达我的谢意。你帮了乔迪，也帮了猎人们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，只是体能训练。能改变浪尖方向的，不只是那些不听话的坏孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次，记得来捧场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我会的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，我得去找Aya她们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是出个门，就不见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（略感不满的独奏）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了。凯尔希......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经来了，我们总不能白来一趟。等你做好准备，我们随时可以醒来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Aya会这么说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......感谢你们。我们迟早会真正建立起合作关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（表别离的独奏）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，这就是布雷奥甘发现的真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“巨兽”“海神”。它们之间的联系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果海洋从很久以前就没有了这些巨大的生物，而它们都以这种形式在陆地上生存——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"并不相同，歌蕾蒂娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"大炎、萨尔贡、萨米，这些地方都曾面临过由巨兽引发的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，记住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"海洋的异变有其无可取代的特殊性。即使是我，也不知道其具体的原理和轨迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能看见结果，再推测未来。那一定是一个糟糕的未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我想，布雷奥甘还推断出了其他的真相。而如果如你所说，还有一位深海猎人活着的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海神不止一只。我们杀死的那一只，只是阿戈尔文明所遮掩的一小部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你们杀死的那只，就活在斯卡蒂的身体里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那么我最糟糕的猜想成真了。你没有选择返回阿戈尔，是正确的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛已经帮了我们许多，你们也有自己的任务，接下来，我们会自行解决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛......有罗德岛的职责。我们最优秀的干员，会维持罗德岛的运行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"可在这数万年的岁月里，我也有我的职责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"很多次很多次，我都试图去解决阿戈尔面临的问题。但阿戈尔，远离大地，独树一帜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不能再拖延了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"海洋的问题与源石已是同等级别。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_0"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果文明想要延续，我们就必须战胜这场浩劫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_kxstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"尽管这个世界仍旧纷争不断，隔阂与战火从未停歇，正如斯图提斐拉其名。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"泰拉既载满了弊病与愚昧的痴人，也载满从癫狂与无序中寻找理性的圣徒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，你已经知道了进化的源头，验证了所有想法。阿戈尔的城市已经触手可及，傲慢如伊比利亚也放弃了作茧自缚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"总战争设计师阁下，开始吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不满地摇摆脖颈）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安分点，罗辛南特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（更大幅度地摇摆脖颈）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......罗辛南特......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶鸣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们要去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨浪，即将来临。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们，战胜巨浪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们，即是巨浪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨浪。只要海里还有水，天上还有月亮，空中还有风，浪涛就不会平息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在疯狂中窥见的目标，还真是过度雄伟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走！（沙哑的咆哮）走吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（欢快的嘶鸣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沙哑的咆哮）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不允许，海，再有丁点涟漪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
